      "sourceLink": null,
      "spam": false,
      "statusChangeID": null,
      "value": "This is expected when your fallback is scaled and proportioned very differently from your actual avatar. Try to find an avatar close in proportions and scale to yours, or create a custom fallback. The method for scaling tries to get the viewpoints similar so you are seeing eye to eye. If the other proportions are different, this could lift or sink the fallback.",
      "viewerReactions": null
    },
