      "statusChangeID": "61354af48b0f3b50faf88579",
      "statusChangeNewStatus": "closed",
      "value": "This is expected behavior. Scaling tries its best to ensure the most important points match up (viewpoint, most of all) but will fail to be completely precise in some cases.\nWe don't plan on improving this behavior at this time, but might circle back around to it once the Fallaback improvements have released and we've had a chance to see how they work.",
      "viewerReactions": null
    }
